# GitHub issue and PR templates.
#
# These are routinely edited through GitHub's web template editor, which rewrites
# the YAML frontmatter in a style Prettier rejects — single-quoted strings and a
# blank line before the closing `---` — so every edit made that way failed CI on
# formatting alone. Nothing imports these files and GitHub renders them itself,
# so the round trip is not worth defending.
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
